{"speciesId":856,"names":{"fr":"Bibichut","es":"Hatenna","en":"Hatenna","ja":"ミブリム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La protubérance sur sa tête lui permet de percevoir les émotions des êtres vivants. Il n’accorde sa confiance qu’aux gens calmes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Percibe los sentimientos de los seres vivos con la protuberancia de la cabeza. Solo abre su corazón a quienes muestren un carácter sosegado."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other creatures’ emotions. If you don’t have a calm disposition, it will never warm up to you."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭の 突起で 生物の 気持ちを 感じとる。 穏やかな ものにしか 心を 開かない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il aime les lieux inhabités. S’il perçoit des émotions trop fortes, il s’enfuit aussi vite que possible."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Siente predilección por los lugares despoblados. Si percibe una emoción intensa, emprende la huida a toda prisa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"If this Pokémon senses a strong emotion, it will run away as fast as it can. It prefers areas without people."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人気の ない 場所が 好き。 強い 感情を 感じとると 一目散に 逃げ出してしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":856,"moves":[{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[20,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confusion","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[20,"level-up",40],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",40],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"metronome","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","le